---
description: Git commit attribution rules for this repository
alwaysApply: true
---

Never add "Co-authored-by: Cursor", "Made with Cursor", "cursoragent@cursor.com", or any Cursor/agent attribution to commits or PRs.

When creating commits, use only the repository author identity (yngkim). Do not use ROKEY-SPARK or Cursor Agent as author or co-author.
